---
title: Editable Presentation Subsystem
---
flowchart TB
    User([User or confirmed MCP call]) --> API[Presentation API]
    Feedback([Selected-slide feedback]) --> API
    API --> Job[(Owned durable job<br/>and progressive checkpoints)]
    Job --> Worker[Leased background worker]
    Worker --> Agent[PresentationAgent]
    Agent --> Gate[Redis foreground-priority gate]
    Gate --> Inference[Provider-neutral<br/>inference adapter]
    Inference --> Gemma[Gemma 4 12B<br/>outline, slide, or edit]
    Gemma --> Compiler[Deterministic editable<br/>DeckSpec compiler]
    Compiler --> Visuals{Useful slide image?}
    Visuals -->|yes, bounded| HiDream[HiDream via ComfyUI]
    Visuals -->|no or unavailable| Render
    HiDream --> Render[PptxGenJS render<br/>and Office validation]
    Render --> Revision[(Append-only revision<br/>and private PPTX)]
    Revision --> Job
    Job -->|progress, reconnect and download| UI[Presentations UI]

    Boundary[Application alone owns<br/>access, storage and promotion]
    Boundary -.-> Job
    Boundary -.-> Revision

